# Unity Scene Structure

**Scenes (RoobsWorld/Assets/Scenes/ or equivalent):**

- MainMenu, CellStage, CreatureStage, TribalStage, CivStage, SpaceStage, CreatureEditor.
- Build Settings must include all required scenes; use RoobsWorldBuildSettingsSetup or add manually.

**Bootstrap:**

- Bootstrap runs in the first loaded scene; ensures managers exist (EventBus, GameManager, SaveManager, etc.) and starts Main Menu or Cell Stage.
- Assign InputActionAsset (e.g. InputSystem_Actions) to Bootstrap when using New Input System.

**Stage FSM:**

- One-way transitions: Cell → Creature → Tribal → Civilization → Space. Each stage owns its scene(s), camera rig, and UI.
